   "e": "06zxvzzswo2ysfzpwqnxvwtsmuumsmygtoe00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "W.A.L.T.-E is a rusted barbecue robot with one book: Plato's Republic, stained with oil and Dr Pepper. He asks Plato's oldest question. What is a thing for?",
