  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "W.A.L.T.-E",
   "text": "Plato called it ergon. The work a thing does best. A knife cuts. An eye sees. Now tell me, Hank: what is your ergon?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep01/v08.wav",
   "d": 8.512,
   "e": "0tzsztzooxmvxqqbrxgtiqxqok9tsvppuuutj000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BIG HANK",
   "text": "Excavation. Refining. Hauling.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep01/v09.wav",
   "d": 3.315,
   "e": "000uvjyuzxovupsbrzztrocdywtmja0000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "W.A.L.T.-E",
   "text": "So if your function is harvest, and you refuse, you become what?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep01/v10.wav",
   "d": 4.487,
   "e": "00uztynutuxqjzuoj1pzxxaryugppltsuc000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BIG HANK",
   "text": "Waste.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep01/v11.wav",
   "d": 1.015,
   "e": "00000000006glptwzzyzzzyvuri9540000990000"
  },
  {
